21:T19b4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date","url":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date","name":"New Skoda Elroq Promises 570+ km Driving Range and Premium Cabin Tech","description":"Skoda Elroq 2026 India launch date, price (₹25–35 lakh), 573 km range, 175kW fast charging, ADAS, 77kWh battery & full specs. Compare with BYD Atto 3 & Ioniq 5.","inLanguage":"en-IN","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date#primaryimage"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date#breadcrumb"},"datePublished":"2026-05-18","dateModified":"2026-05-20","speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1","#ai-snapshot",".post-content p:first-of-type"]},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","audienceType":"Digital Marketing Professionals, SEO Experts","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India"}},"potentialAction":{"@type":"ReadAction","target":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date"}},{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date#article","headline":"New Skoda Elroq Promises 570+ km Driving Range and Premium Cabin Tech","name":"New Skoda Elroq Promises 570+ km Driving Range and Premium Cabin Tech","description":"Skoda Elroq 2026 India launch date, price (₹25–35 lakh), 573 km range, 175kW fast charging, ADAS, 77kWh battery & full specs. Compare with BYD Atto 3 & Ioniq 5.","datePublished":"2026-05-18","dateModified":"2026-05-20","author":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#person/kapil-kumar","name":"Kapil Kumar","url":"https://chatwizs.com/author/kapil-kumar","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=100&q=80","jobTitle":"Tech and non-Tech Content Writer","description":"","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/prasantbagriya/","https://prashantbagriya.graphy.com/"]},"publisher":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#organization"},"image":["/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg","/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg?ar=1x1","/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg?ar=4x3","/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg?ar=16x9"],"mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date"},"articleBody":"Hello, friends here is the latest update for all the car lovers and buyers who are planning to own a new electric car. Skoda announced the launch of an all new Elroq claiming 570+ km, premium cabin, 175 kW fast charging and multiple features with the starting price of ₹45 lakh in Indian Market.In this new Skoda Elroq you will see outstanding design, luxurious interior, powerful motor and advanced features making it a futuristic car. Lets explore the new upcoming Skoda Elroq 2026 through this page.Skoda Elroq EV 2026 Price &amp; Launch DateBefore starting, the most important things to know are the expected price and launch timeline of the Skoda Elroq. Skoda is likely to launch this premium EV in India by mid-2026. Looking at its features and positioning, the expected price range could be between ₹35 lakh and ₹45 lakh (ex-showroom).Skoda Elroq 2026 EVBuyers and enthusiasts waiting for the new Skoda Elroq EV are updated that Skoda has given final touch to the Elroq and is planning to introduce it by next month June 2026. In this upcoming EV Skoda offers interesting features like fast charging, ADAS, a 13-inch touchscreen, and connected car features. The EV could come with 59 kWh and 77 kWh battery options, and up to 573 km range, ideal for both long and city drives.New Skoda Elroq 2026 Range &amp; PerformanceSkoda Elroq 2026 model comes with a powerful 63 kWh and 82 kWh battery packs which delivers around 204 PS and 286 PS and 573 km WLTP range. If we talk about its charging support then in 10 – 80% charging in just 24 – 28 minutes. When it comes to its performance then it reaches 0 to 100 km/h in 6.6 seconds. Buyers who want a stylish, powerful and compact EV then Skoda Elroq 2026 is the best option for you.Skoda Elroq EV 2026 Model Key Specifications&nbsp;Vehicle TypePremium Compact Electric SUVExpected LaunchMid 2026Expected Price₹35 lakh – ₹45 lakh (ex-showroom)Battery Pack59 kWh – 77 kWhDriving RangeUp to 573 kmFast Charging175 kW DC Fast ChargingCharging Time10% to 80% in 28 minutesBoot Space470 Litres2026 Elroq EV Interior and Exterior FeaturesSkoda Elroq 2026 model is a feature-rich compact EV with a premium and modern cabin. Its interior gets a 13-inch touchscreen, digital driver display, wireless charging, connected car tech, premium audio system, and multiple comfort features. On the outside, the SUV comes with a stylish design, sharp LED lighting, sporty alloy wheels, and aerodynamic styling that gives it a futuristic road presence.Who Should Buy a New Elroq EV?Basically, Skoda Elroq 2026 is designed for those buyers who want a stylish look, premium cabin, long driving range, and a compact SUV with modern EV technology. With its luxury features, fast charging support, and practical design, it can become a strong option in the premium electric SUV segment.Skoda Elroq Maintenance and Running CostThe Skoda Elroq is expected to have lower maintenance costs compared to petrol and diesel SUVs. Since EVs have fewer moving parts, owners may spend less on regular servicing and engine-related repairs. Fast charging support and modern battery technology can also make daily usage more convenient and efficient.","keywords":"","wordCount":520,"timeRequired":"PT3M","inLanguage":"en-IN","isAccessibleForFree":true,"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India","sameAs":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q668"}},"reviewedBy":{"@type":"Person","name":"Prasant Bagriya","jobTitle":"Editorial Reviewer"},"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"General"}],"mentions":[]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://chatwizs.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"General","item":"https://chatwizs.com/category/general"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"New Skoda Elroq Promises 570+ km Driving Range and Premium Cabin Tech","item":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/skoda-elroq-2026-price-india-launch-date"}]}]}17:["$","article",null,{"itemScope":true,"itemType":"https://schema.org/BlogPosting","style":{"width":"100%","maxWidth":"1200px","margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","$L20",null,{}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"preload","as":"image","href":"/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg","fetchPriority":"high","imageSizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","imageSrcSet":"/uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg?w=640 640w, /uploads/media-1779256045367-325491172.jpg?w=1200 1200w"}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}],"$L22","$L23","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]
