29:["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Hello, friends here is the latest update for all the car lovers and buyers who are planning to own a new electric car. Skoda announced the launch of an all new Elroq claiming 570+ km, premium cabin, 175 kW fast charging and multiple features with the starting price of ₹45 lakh in Indian Market."}]}]
2a:["$","p","1",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":"In this new"}]," Skoda Elroq you will see outstanding design, luxurious interior, powerful motor and advanced features making it a futuristic car. Lets explore the new upcoming Skoda Elroq 2026 through this page."]}]}]
2b:["$","h3","2",{"id":"h3-skoda-elroq-ev-2026-price-amp-launch-date-0","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(30, 0, 255)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Skoda Elroq EV 2026 Price & Launch Date"}]}]}]
2c:["$","p","3",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Before starting, the most important things to know are the expected price and launch timeline of the Skoda Elroq. Skoda is likely to launch this premium EV in India by mid-2026. Looking at its features and positioning, the expected price range could be between ₹35 lakh and ₹45 lakh (ex-showroom)."}]}]
2d:["$","h3","4",{"id":"h3-skoda-elroq-2026-ev-1","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Skoda Elroq 2026 EV"}]}]}]
2e:["$","p","5",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Buyers and enthusiasts waiting for the new Skoda Elroq EV are updated that Skoda has given final touch to the Elroq and is planning to introduce it by next month June 2026. In this upcoming EV Skoda offers interesting features like fast charging, ADAS, a 13-inch touchscreen, and connected car features. The EV could come with 59 kWh and 77 kWh battery options, and up to 573 km range, ideal for both long and city drives."}]}]
2f:["$","h3","6",{"id":"h3-new-skoda-elroq-2026-range-amp-performance-2","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"New Skoda Elroq 2026 Range & Performance"}]}]}]
30:["$","p","7",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Skoda Elroq 2026 model comes with a powerful 63 kWh and 82 kWh battery packs which delivers around 204 PS and 286 PS and 573 km WLTP range. If we talk about its charging support then in 10 – 80% charging in just 24 – 28 minutes. When it comes to its performance then it reaches 0 to 100 km/h in 6.6 seconds. Buyers who want a stylish, powerful and compact EV then Skoda Elroq 2026 is the best option for you."}]}]
