34:["$","p","11",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Skoda Elroq 2026 model is a feature-rich compact EV with a premium and modern cabin. Its interior gets a 13-inch touchscreen, digital driver display, wireless charging, connected car tech, premium audio system, and multiple comfort features. On the outside, the SUV comes with a stylish design, sharp LED lighting, sporty alloy wheels, and aerodynamic styling that gives it a futuristic road presence."}]}]
