36:["$","p","13",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Basically, Skoda Elroq 2026 is designed for those buyers who want a stylish look, premium cabin, long driving range, and a compact SUV with modern EV technology. With its luxury features, fast charging support, and practical design, it can become a strong option in the premium electric SUV segment."}]}]
