38:["$","p","15",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"The Skoda Elroq is expected to have lower maintenance costs compared to petrol and diesel SUVs. Since EVs have fewer moving parts, owners may spend less on regular servicing and engine-related repairs. Fast charging support and modern battery technology can also make daily usage more convenient and efficient."}]}]
